{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52222","headline":"颂六十二首 四十七 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 四十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贵富诤人我，贪贱自然羞。\n强弱相辜负，鬬讼未曾休。\n耻恨相侵夺，觅便报其讐。\n怨结恒对值，累劫常苦愁。\n（见同书卷七二《诤讼篇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}